    "detailed_description": "<strong>No exceptions!</strong><br>Make the streets (in)secure as the Master Chief of Criminal Complaints and conquer the leaderboard of the local online watch!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >You are the hero the city deserves!</h2>Your weapon? The phone. Your mission? Report road obstructions. Whether it's illegally parked cars, fallen scooters, or other offenses, nothing escapes your trained eye.<br>Utilize the full power of the traffic regulations and save the city from absolute traffic chaos!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\">[]Up to 8 players report traffic offenses competitively[]Skillfully dodge pedestrians so you can use your phone undisturbed[]Unlock cosmetic items for your character and your bike[]Play in global or private lobbies</ul>",
